          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When can I expect my order to arrive?",
            "answer": "<p>Most Cuszoo products are personalized and made especially for you, so your order needs time for both production and shipping.</p><p>Under normal circumstances, the estimated total delivery time is:</p><ul><li><strong>United States: 10–20 business days</strong></li><li><strong>International destinations: 15–25 business days</strong></li></ul><p>These estimates may vary during peak seasons or because of customs clearance, severe weather, carrier delays, or other circumstances outside our control.</p><p>Once your order has shipped, we’ll send a confirmation email containing your tracking details. If you don’t see it in your inbox, please check your spam or junk folder.</p>"
