          "settings": {
            "question": "Why isn’t my tracking number showing any information?",
            "answer": "<p>Tracking information usually becomes available within <strong>48–96 hours</strong> after you receive your shipping confirmation.</p><p>A tracking number may be created before the carrier completes its first scan, so it can take a few days for the initial update to appear. Some products and shipping routes may require a little more time.</p><p>If your tracking still shows no information after 96 hours, please contact us with your order number and tracking number.</p>"
